 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"I'm sorry — I'm feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Will you help me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Rest won't touch this. The heat's climbing and my head's full of cotton. Someone who knows what they're doing — please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Wilhelm always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "You show them Elderberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"What scares you most about what's happening? The real answer. You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They go quiet. \"Yeah. Me too. The randomness would almost be kinder.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"That we're interesting to it. Being watched means being kept. I'd rather be boring to the sky. Boring things get left alone. It'll pass.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"I, uh — Still on what scares you most.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"I dreamed Wilhelm was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Okay. That's — I need a minute. A long minute.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"This cut — I can't clean it properly one-handed. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"We lost Knut and Aruzhan. I do the headcount without thinking. Then I think.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You show them Elderberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"We lost Knut and Aruzhan this week. I keep setting out extra portions. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "It's quiet at the cache spot. Nora doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Aruzhan said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Aruzhan. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You show them Elderberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  }
 ],
